# Data Constitution

Read and obey `harness/constitutions/data.md`.

- Database-per-service; no cross-service foreign keys.
- Plural `snake_case` tables; `ix_` / `uq_` / `ck_` prefixes.
- One service may use multiple stores; declare them in `project.yaml`.
- Alembic expand/contract for breaking changes.
